{"candidateAnswer":"A vibrant rainbow sidewalk","evidence":"[D14:23 | 1:33 pm on 25 August, 2023] Caroline: I was out walking in my neighborhood when I came across this cool rainbow sidewalk for Pride Month. It was so vibrant and welcoming, I had to take a picture! It reminds us that love and acceptance are everywhere—even where we least expect it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:d938c88b-4a80-5e04-bcb7-dfa5baedfdf0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8110b3b36b7b8e10471c138b4346c7e50e291b3e56e1199da916f33b3b9f4925","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Caroline find in her neighborhood during her walk?","referenceAnswer":"a rainbow sidewalk","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8110b3b36b7b8e10471c138b4346c7e50e291b3e56e1199da916f33b3b9f4925"}}]}